[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2660318954","pull_request_review_id":3625523202,"id":2660318954,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6ekT7q","diff_hunk":"@@ -70,7 +70,9 @@ void AnimationPlayerEditor::_find_player() {\n \tTypedArray<Node> players = edited_scene->find_children(\"\", \"AnimationPlayer\");\n \n \tif (players.size() == 1) {\n+\t\t// Replicating EditorNode::_plugin_over_edit to ensure an identical setup as when selecting manually\n \t\tplugin->edit(players.front());\n+\t\tplugin->make_visible(true);","path":"editor/animation/animation_player_editor_plugin.cpp","commit_id":"fe5450298758d86041fc444b4942dfd136312d92","original_commit_id":"4b720efd0ceefb596026fec580197ecf9257681f","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Isn't the actual important part the function inside `make_visible()` such as `set_process(true)`? Does it absolutely have to be `make_visible()`? I am concerned that in cases where the AnimationPlayer is explicitly hidden, it might still be forced to visible. Although, I don't recall if such cases actually exist.\r\n\r\nAnother approach might be to call `set_process(true)` within the `edit()` function when the AnimationPlayerEditor is displayed like `set_process(is_visible());`.","created_at":"2026-01-05T05:23:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T05:30:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603#discussion_r2660318954","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2660318954"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603#discussion_r2660318954"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2660318954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":75,"original_line":75,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2660609354","pull_request_review_id":3625832125,"id":2660609354,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6ela1K","diff_hunk":"@@ -70,7 +70,9 @@ void AnimationPlayerEditor::_find_player() {\n \tTypedArray<Node> players = edited_scene->find_children(\"\", \"AnimationPlayer\");\n \n \tif (players.size() == 1) {\n+\t\t// Replicating EditorNode::_plugin_over_edit to ensure an identical setup as when selecting manually\n \t\tplugin->edit(players.front());\n+\t\tplugin->make_visible(true);","path":"editor/animation/animation_player_editor_plugin.cpp","commit_id":"fe5450298758d86041fc444b4942dfd136312d92","original_commit_id":"4b720efd0ceefb596026fec580197ecf9257681f","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"My original thought was to just move `set_process(true)` into `_find_player`, but I was worried about potential other unknown inconsistencies, or new ones down the road. My thought was that if we ensure it is activated the same way it would be via node selection, then we shouldn't have any inconsistencies between the two activation methods.\r\n\r\nI don't think we have a risk here of making the panel visible when it should be, since there is already a guard checking if the editor is visible at the start of `_find_player`, so we are only hitting this call once the pane is already visible. If there isn't any issue with moving the `set_process` call into `edit` though I'm happy to do that, and I can see if there's anything else that should be ensured on every edit call, not just when the panel is made visible.","created_at":"2026-01-05T08:03:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T08:03:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603#discussion_r2660609354","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2660609354"},"html":{"href":